serves more than lasers and lightshows – let us strive for the beauty and variety that the stars deserve.'&quot; <br>     <i>- Rock, Paper, Shotgun</i><br><br>&quot;Bites off way more than it can chew, and it’s endlessly endearing for it.&quot;<br>     <i>- GiantBomb</i>",
